#: ffa47a5e97664ef993102ee1a4180458
msgid "FlightGear Hardware-in-the-Loop Simulation"
msgstr "FlightGear 硬件在环仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:7
#: 17c01705297b4a1db98911374f9675b4
msgid "Archived, no longer supported"
msgstr "已归档，不再支持"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:9
#: 6b9e58cbf7c64bd280d53bd021155f41
msgid ""
"`FlightGear <http://www.flightgear.org/about/>`__ is an open-source free "
"flight simulator. This article explains how to use this hardware-in-the-loop"
" simulator with Plane (only)."
msgstr ""
"`FlightGear <http://www.flightgear.org/about/>`__ "
"是一款开源免费飞行仿真器。本文介绍如何将此硬件在环仿真器与 Plane（仅限）配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:15
#: 63a1f7a4fec249d4a32e418f31c6e517
msgid ""
"This is a community-submitted article. It should work, but has not been "
"verified by the official dev team. Questions and requests for help should be"
" made in the DIY Drones forums."
msgstr "这是一篇由社区提交的文章。该方法应可正常运行，但未经官方开发团队验证。问题和帮助请求应在 DIY Drones 论坛中提出。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:22
#: 837b70c1f3a54815815f8ad54ac1ce9f
msgid "Flightgear screenshot"
msgstr "Flightgear 截图"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:25
#: ae3b1daa701c492bbb8916cf93cc708b
msgid "Things you need"
msgstr "所需条件"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:27
#: ab8975d6805340c6bd09e68846ec611b
msgid ""
"`Flightgear <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ (tested Flight Gear v2.x, "
"currently at v3.4)"
msgstr ""
"`Flightgear <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__（已测试 Flight Gear v2.x，当前版本 v3.4）"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:29
#: d66cd98aa20c419682f663d89b65cfa7
msgid ""
"`Mission Planner "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__ (Windows)"
msgstr ""
"`Mission Planner "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.msi>`__（Windows）"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:31
#: f1db587b73f5468b82582440149409be
msgid ""
"ArduPilot HIL on your APM (via APM Planner, currently (April 2013) only "
"v2.68 HIL works, see below)"
msgstr "APM 上的 ArduPilot HIL（通过 APM Planner，目前（2013年4月）仅 v2.68 HIL 可用，见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:33
#: a468a29e52ed4acfa7d865863a27e56b
msgid ""
"`Mavlink.xml <https://github.com/dronekit/ardupilot-"
"releases/blob/master/Tools/FlightGear/MAVLink.xml>`__ data format file for "
"flightgear"
msgstr ""
"用于 FlightGear 的 `Mavlink.xml <https://github.com/dronekit/ardupilot-"
"releases/blob/master/Tools/FlightGear/MAVLink.xml>`__ 数据格式文件"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:35
#: cb499777fac34efbbcb8c1f952b652a5
msgid ""
"Recommended for Windows OS: the file: \\ `system.fgfsrc "
"<https://code.google.com/p/ardupilot-"
"mega/downloads/detail?name=system.fgfsrc>`__ placed into the \"C:\\\\Program"
" Files (x86)\\\\FlightGear\\\\data\" folder. This will load the Rascal RC "
"plane and a few other parameters. More information on what is loaded \\ "
"`here <http://wiki.flightgear.org/Fgfsrc>`__, you can alter it to your own "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Windows 系统推荐：将文件 `system.fgfsrc <https://code.google.com/p/ardupilot-"
"mega/downloads/detail?name=system.fgfsrc>`__ 放入 「C:\\\\Program Files "
"(x86)\\\\FlightGear\\\\data」 文件夹。这将加载 Rascal RC 固定翼及其他一些参数。有关加载内容的更多信息请参见 "
"`这里 <http://wiki.flightgear.org/Fgfsrc>`__，您可以根据自己的需求修改。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:44
#: ce6cf70a7eb847749f5ee23065aadec6
msgid "How to make it work"
msgstr "操作方法"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:48
#: 76076156b07e45ec9b9d9239a88d6b77
msgid ""
"Safety first: Disconnect the 3 wires from your brushless motor otherwise it "
"will start when you advance the throttle (if in manual mode)."
msgstr "安全第一：断开无刷电机的 3 根导线，否则在推油门时电机会启动（如果处于手动模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:52
#: 4ede7b9fcdae46a794ce627372c5158c
msgid "Download and install the FlightGear Flight Sim if you have not already"
msgstr "如果尚未安装，请下载并安装 FlightGear 飞行仿真器"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:54
#: d7ce5a4833ea4dc5a2a4795ded836666
msgid "Copy Mavlink.xml to C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\FlightGear\\\\data\\\\Protocol"
msgstr "将 Mavlink.xml 复制到 C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\FlightGear\\\\data\\\\Protocol"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:56
#: 8f3d480ddd86498783995b68007c72b6
msgid ""
"In the Mission Planner > 'Configuration tab \\| Adv Parameter List' save "
"your current parameters so you can reload them after the simulation"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 的「配置选项卡 \\| 高级参数列表」中保存当前参数，以便仿真结束后重新加载"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:59
#: c1865ac652c74820bfada500271dd4fd
msgid ""
"In the Firmware tab of the MP, choose 'Pick previous firmware', from the "
"drop down list pick the 4th one down, firmware should show as Plane v2.68, "
"then click 'HIL Simulator \\| Plane' to load the Plane firmware onto your "
"APM."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的固件选项卡中，选择「选择以前的固件」，从下拉列表中选择第 4 项，固件应显示为 Plane "
"v2.68，然后点击「HIL 仿真器 \\| Plane」将 Plane 固件加载到您的 APM。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:63
#: c6278413b42242c9875e0dcd21dd4914
msgid ""
"Connect to the APM, then open the Simulation tab of the Mission Planner"
msgstr "连接到 APM，然后打开 Mission Planner 的仿真选项卡"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:65
#: 405c6e71edab4629ba2bc8a45bcc4d5d
msgid ""
"Check the FlightGear radio button, then click the 'Start FG Plane' button."
msgstr "勾选 FlightGear 单选按钮，然后点击「Start FG Plane」按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:67
#: e5378f499c304ce484510609d7045659
msgid ""
"After FG has finished loading click the 'Sim Link Start/Stop' button in the "
"MP"
msgstr "FG 加载完成后，点击 Mission Planner 中的「Sim Link Start/Stop」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:69
#: a5d90248323e4ed58d3f89c7cd000ad2
msgid ""
"In FG press ' v ' on the keyboard to get an outside view of the plane, ' x '"
" to zoom, move your aileron stick to see if the planes ailerons move, great "
"if they do, go through this list again if not."
msgstr ""
"在 FG 中按键盘上的 'v' 键获取飞机外部视角，按 'x' 键缩放，移动副翼摇杆查看飞机副翼是否动作，如果动作则表示成功，否则请重新检查上述步骤。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:72
#: 94a4e709315a4abca8fb35264693ecd9
msgid ""
"Now in the Mission Planner do your usual radio setup including calibration "
"and mode switch setup, then you can fly Missions and test the APM just like "
"you would on a real plane."
msgstr ""
"现在在 Mission Planner 中进行常规遥控器设置，包括校准和模式开关设置，然后您就可以执行任务并测试 APM，就像操作真实飞机一样。"

#: ../../source/docs/flightgear-hardware-in-the-loop-simulation.rst:78
#: 0912d36430ad415ab7e9508cd9431311
msgid ""
"If you used the file \"`system.fgfsrc "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/windows_parameter_file_for_flightgear_HIL_simulator_system.fgfsrc.zip>`__\\"
" \" then you can just increase your throttle to fly the Rascal plane. If you"
" didn't and are flying the default Cessna, hold down 's' on the keyboard to "
"start the plane's engine, then advance your throttle to take off."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用了文件「`system.fgfsrc "
"<https://download.ardupilot.org/downloads/wiki/advanced_user_tools/windows_parameter_file_for_flightgear_HIL_simulator_system.fgfsrc.zip>`__」，则只需增大油门即可飞行"
" Rascal 固定翼。如果没有使用该文件而是飞行默认的塞斯纳，请按住键盘上的 's' 键启动发动机，然后推油门起飞。"
